    "rarity": "Elite",
    "image": "images/weather-report.svg",
    "description": "## May be obtained by rolling as an elite.\n\n---\n\n> 1. Can be evolved into\n> 2. Can be evolved into\n> 3. Can be evolved into\n\n---\n\n## Shinies/Variations\n\n-  (put if applicable)\n- ‌\n\n---\n\n## **Moveset**\n\n### **LMB - Punches**\n\n> The user punches 4 times before doing a heavy hit that deals 8 damage.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of NIL\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-14ac97c2ac922623.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74e24bcf135e8ff3bfc1ba/download/ezgif-14ac97c2ac922623.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **E - Barrage**\n\n> Deals 33 damage, 18 one damage hits along with a 15 damage finisher that slightly knocks back the opponent.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 8 seconds.\n\n![this\\_mgiht\\_be\\_too\\_laggy.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74d76fb474a7e2c2a3a071/download/this_mgiht_be_too_laggy.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **R - Heavy Hit**\n\n> Does a heavy hit that does 15 damage and knocks back enemies.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 15 seconds.\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-109791862003bdf5.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74e38de5a7b3885c13c5a4/download/ezgif-109791862003bdf5.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **T - Tornado Throw**\n\n> The user throws a ranged wind attack, that has far knockback and deals 14 damage.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 20 seconds.\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-502d312889515391.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74dd187abb79aa16bc9918/download/ezgif-502d312889515391.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **Y - Air Pressure Burst**\n\n> It is a combo extender that does 10 damage and a light push.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 12 seconds.\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-5cf6cbb9190a2987.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74dc5771f17ff2982aef59/download/ezgif-5cf6cbb9190a2987.gif)\n\n---\n\n---\n\n### **G - Heavy Weather**\n\n> The user shoots out a rainbow that deals 10 damage on impact but also causes the victim to be turning into a snail dealing 1 damage every second for 6 seconds.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 22 seconds.\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-5b8cbcaea1d8a9f4.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74dffd9c568bdf0994804c/download/ezgif-5b8cbcaea1d8a9f4.gif)\n\n---\n\n---\n\n### **H - Thunder Strike**\n\n> The user calls down lightning to strike their enemy/enemies it deals 13 damage per person, and they can only be hit once.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 30 seconds.\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-5f17186b6044375e.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74d9c97af2df3499cb5526/download/ezgif-5f17186b6044375e.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **Z - Grab Combo**\n\n> The user grabs the enemy for 4 damage before throwing them away for 12 more damage and has a large knockback. Total damage=16\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 12 seconds.\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-5291e5d8e22d0796.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a74d5392d0509ca6464a943/attachments/6a74d884fe883744d3bcc972/download/ezgif-5291e5d8e22d0796.gif)"
