    "name": "The World",
    "rarity": "Elite",
    "image": "images/the-world.svg",
    "description": "## May be obtained by using x on y.\n\n---\n\n> 1. Can be evolved into TWOH using Dio’s Diary.\n> 2. Can be evolved into The Dingle using Dingle’s Diary\n> 3. Can be evolved into ???\n\n---\n\n## Shinies/Variations\n\n- Shadow The World\n- Event Winner\n\n---\n\n---\n\n### **E - Barrage**\n\n> E - Barrage\n> Deals 34 damage, 19 one damage hits along with a 15 damage finisher that slightly knocks back the opponent.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 8 seconds.\n>\n> ![ezgif-31b12afc8981b0c3.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a6ecd501f3e8c215c733720/attachments/6a7514e175fe63cb873d6fdd/download/ezgif-31b12afc8981b0c3.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **R - Impale**\n\n> Rips a hole open in the Opponents chest stunning them for a small duration and dealing 25 damage.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 10 seconds.\n\n![ezgif-3b1e7262dfce2746.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a6ecd501f3e8c215c733720/attachments/6a75154a0ca03fc2c95d8199/download/ezgif-3b1e7262dfce2746.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **T - Teleport**\n\n> The user teleports a medium distance fowards.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 5 seconds.\n\n![ezgif-37f4117ab80c2c4e.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a6ecd501f3e8c215c733720/attachments/6a75164dd6df54b862af14ed/download/ezgif-37f4117ab80c2c4e.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **Y - Beatdown**\n\n> The world grabs the enemy before hitting them stopping time and proceeding to combo in stopped time. 20 Damage and looks epic.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 35 seconds.\n\nGif/Image of move\n\n![ezgif-3e917d9d47a83b2c.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a6ecd501f3e8c215c733720/attachments/6a7510183fd98383e5996b23/download/ezgif-3e917d9d47a83b2c.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **G - Knives**\n\n> The user throws 5 knives dealing 2.8 damage each. For a total of 14 if they all hit.\n> This has a cooldown of 8 seconds.\n\n![ezgif-367e5874a9ba2a43.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a6ecd501f3e8c215c733720/attachments/6a7516e0fdc1d2aa8263669b/download/ezgif-367e5874a9ba2a43.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **H - Timestop**\n\n> The user stops the flow of time for 5 seconds takes about 2 to activate if you get hit it gets cancelled.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 60 seconds.\n\n![ezgif-33b9c3fbc06607e1.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6a6ecd501f3e8c215c733720/attachments/6a75174fdc6e5373a6e40542/download/ezgif-33b9c3fbc06607e1.gif)\n\n---\n\n### **Z - Kick Combo**\n\n> The user kicks the enemy before taking them up into the air and kicking them a lot more following it with a heavy kick that sends them down.\n>\n> This has a cooldown of 24 seconds."
